d for $800,000, if they think that will pay off in the end.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Can there be solar for all, everywhere by 2030?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae500770859784833cb6e2d415a491969d0740369fd5201675b53f46f8c3f14d</id><updated>2026-10-02T14:49:15Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T13:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-there-be-solar-for-all-everywhere-by-2030/a-79517056--2e42319aeceb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/can-there-be-solar-for-all-everywhere-by-2030/a-79517056?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Prominent climate leaders have called on governments, businesses, institutions and the public to make a push for solar power before the decade is out, repowering the world with cheap, clean energy. Is that possible?</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>North and South Korea trade accusations over landmines that injured three soldiers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:294f2dcca33b1e14e0d52d12d705f0f8b2c02dffb020bdd114dc275bc6062082</id><updated>2026-10-02T14:48:12Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T13:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-and-south-korea-trade-accusations-over-landmines-that-injured-three-soldiers/a-79503854--57b9ec347358.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-and-south-korea-trade-accusations-over-landmines-that-injured-three-soldiers/a-79503854?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A mine blast that injured three South Korean soldiers has renewed scrutiny of North Korea's actions along the border and raised questions about its strategic goals.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Manchester City Premier League charges: What do they mean?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a2b4be4694f34226de860e5298969eeceba03fafccb9eb0f4eb6d4155c944660</id><updated>2026-10-02T14:48:12Z</updated><publi